---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border-subtle bg-carbon-bg mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
    <div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wide">F-Uno Center</div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">
      <a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors" href="https://openf1.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">API Source · OpenF1</a>
      <a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors" href="https://jolpi.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">API Source · Jolpica</a>
      <a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors" href="/noticias">Noticias</a>
      <a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors" href="/contacto">Contacto</a>
      <a class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-text-secondary hover:text-primary-container transition-colors" href="/donar">Donar</a>
    </div>
    <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary text-center max-w-3xl">
      Este sitio web es no oficial y no está asociado de ninguna manera con el
      grupo de compañías de la Formula 1. F1, FORMULA ONE, FORMULA 1, FIA FORMULA
      ONE WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP, GRAND PRIX y marcas relacionadas son marcas
      registradas de Formula One Licensing B.V.
    </p>
    <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-secondary text-center">
      © {year} F-Uno Center — hecho con Astro. Todos los datos pueden variar.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>